msgstr "~"

#: ../../decisions/0008-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-readthedocs-documentation.md
msgid "Zero-cost / GitHub-native"
msgstr "ゼロコスト / GitHubネイティブ"

#: ../../decisions/0008-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-readthedocs-documentation.md
msgid "Contributor ergonomics (PR-based, no proprietary tooling)"
msgstr "コントリビューターエルゴノミクス（PRベース、独自ツールなし）"

#: ../../decisions/0008-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-readthedocs-documentation.md
msgid "Low build-time / config complexity"
msgstr "低ビルド時間 / 設定複雑さ"

#: ../../decisions/0008-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-readthedocs-documentation.md
msgid "Reuses existing `docs/conf.py` i18n config"
msgstr "既存の `docs/conf.py` i18n設定を再利用"

#: ../../decisions/0008-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-readthedocs-documentation.md:130
msgid "Concrete implementation steps for a follow-up PR"
msgstr "フォローアップPRの具体的な実装ステップ"

#: ../../decisions/0008-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-readthedocs-documentation.md:132
msgid ""
"**Generate `.pot` templates**: Run `sphinx-build -b gettext docs "
"docs/_build/gettext` to extract translatable strings from the "
"documentation source."
msgstr ""
"**`.pot` テンプレートの生成**: `sphinx-build -b gettext docs "
"docs/_build/gettext` を実行してドキュメントソースから翻訳可能な文字列を抽出する。"

#: ../../decisions/0008-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-readthedocs-documentation.md:133
msgid ""
"**Bootstrap Japanese catalogs**: Run `sphinx-intl update -p "
"docs/_build/gettext -l ja` to create `docs/locale/ja/LC_MESSAGES/*.po` "
"files."
msgstr ""
"**日本語カタログのブートストラップ**: `sphinx-intl update -p "
"docs/_build/gettext -l ja` を実行して `docs/locale/ja/LC_MESSAGES/*.po` "
"ファイルを作成する。"

#: ../../decisions/0008-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-readthedocs-documentation.md:134
msgid ""
"**Translate `.po` files**: Edit the `.po` files under "
"`docs/locale/ja/LC_MESSAGES/` with translated `msgstr` entries, "
"preserving reStructuredText/MyST syntax."
msgstr ""
"**`.po` ファイルの翻訳**: `docs/locale/ja/LC_MESSAGES/` 下の `.po` ファイルを"
"翻訳された `msgstr` エントリで編集し、reStructuredText/MyST構文を維持する。"

#: ../../decisions/0008-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-readthedocs-documentation.md:135
msgid ""
"**Configure Read the Docs translation project**: Create a Read the Docs "
"project for `ja` (e.g., `pyvista-wasm-ja`), set its Language to Japanese,"
" point it at the same repository, and add it as a translation of the "
"parent (English) project via the Read the Docs dashboard."
msgstr ""
"**Read the Docs翻訳プロジェクトの設定**: `ja` のRead the Docsプロジェクトを作成し"
"（例: `pyvista-wasm-ja`）、Languageを日本語に設定し、同じリポジトリを指定し"
"、Read the Docsダッシュボードを通じて親（英語）プロジェクトの翻訳として追加する。"

#: ../../decisions/0008-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-readthedocs-documentation.md:136
msgid ""
"**Verify the localized build**: Confirm the Japanese documentation builds"
" on Read the Docs at `/ja/latest/` and the flyout-menu language switcher "
"is visible."
msgstr ""
"**ローカライズビルドの検証**: 日本語ドキュメントがRead the Docsの `/ja/latest/` で"
"ビルドされ、フライアウトメニュ言語スイッチャーが表示されることを確認する。"

#: ../../decisions/0008-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-readthedocs-documentation.md:137
msgid ""
"**Document the translation workflow**: Add a contributor guide to `docs/`"
" explaining how to regenerate `.pot` files, update `.po` catalogs with "
"`sphinx-intl update`, and submit translations via PRs."
msgstr ""
"**翻訳ワークフローの文書化**: `docs/` にコントリビューターガイドを追加し"
"`.pot` ファイルの再生成方法、`sphinx-intl update` による `.po` カタログの更新方法"
"、PRを通じた翻訳の提出方法を説明する。"

#: ../../decisions/0008-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-readthedocs-documentation.md:139
msgid "Read the Docs localization mechanism"
msgstr "Read the Docsローカライズメカニズム"

#: ../../decisions/0008-decide-how-to-internationalize-the-readthedocs-documentation.md:141
msgid ""
"Read the Docs localization is configured via the Read the Docs dashboard,"
" not via a `translations` key in `.readthedocs.yaml`. Each language "
"requires its own Read the Docs project, linked as a \"Translation\" of "
"the parent (English) project. Read the Docs then serves each language at "
"its own URL (e.g., `/ja/latest/`) and provides a flyout-menu language "
"switcher automatically. See the [Read the Docs localization "
"guide](https://docs.readthedocs.com/platform/stable/localization.html) "
"and the [manage-translations for Sphinx "
"guide](https://docs.readthedocs.com/platform/stable/guides/manage-"
"translations-sphinx.html) for details."
msgstr ""
"Read the DocsローカライズはRead the Docsダッシュボードで設定され、`.readthedocs.yaml` の"
"`translations` キーでは設定されない。各言語は独自のRead the Docsプロジェクトを必要とし"
"親（英語）プロジェクトの「Translation」としてリンクされる。Read the Docsは各言語を独自の"
"URL（例: `/ja/latest/`）で提供し、フライアウトメニュ言語スイッチャーを自動的に提供する。"
"詳細は[Read the Docsローカライズガイド](https://docs.readthedocs.com/platform/stable/localization.html)"
"と[manage-translations for Sphinxガイド](https://docs.readthedocs.com/platform/stable/guides/manage-"
"translations-sphinx.html) を参照。"

